  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AX6-QA2-004" ;
  triage:title "AC1 lead-notification threshold doubling (20th reminder) and failed-lead-write retry path still untested (re-assessment of AX6-QA1-002)" ;
  triage:description "AX.6 QA-2 (quality-mgr QA-AX6-R2-1788630712, PR #1204 report 2026-09-05T19:01Z, req-qa) at head c3268df8a3dfa5c84f4465459c5d2ba86df1c837. Re-assessment of AX6-QA1-002 at the new severity: the ax6_01/ax6_02/ax6_03 suites at crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake.rs:1744-1838 now cover the single threshold, no-lead/two-lead and blocked-escalation cadence cases, but AC1's doubling behaviour (tenth reminder produces one lead message, twentieth produces the second) and the failed-lead-write retry-at-next-reminder path are exercised nowhere in the crate. Fix: add tests for both paths in the ax6_01 suite (tests do not count toward RULE-003)." ;
